orkers back to work  rebuilding  america and that's what we've got to do  joe biden and you and i understand  something else that it is incredibly  embarrassing it is humiliating that the  united states of america today this  great country  only is the only major country on earth  not to guarantee  paid medical and family leave  i don't know how many of you know this  we don't talk about it too often  you go to scandinavia woman has a baby  depending on the country she may get  seven eight months off  full paid leave  and the father will get time off as well  and yet in this country beyond belief  a woman today working class woman lower  income woman has a baby  she may be forced to go back to work  next week  or in two weeks because  she needs that job to provide the income  for her family well in my view  if a woman has a baby  if a kid gets sick and mom or dad has to  stay home  we must have paid family and medical  leave  and that is why joe has proposed at  least  12 weeks of paid family and medical  leave  for working families i would go  further but that is a start  brothers and sisters when we talk about  the children and we don't talk about  kids enough in this country  you know that we have the highest rate  of childhood poverty  of almost any major country on earth  and i get a little bit tired of  politicians in washington  many of my colleagues in the senate they  get up there in front of that american  flag and they say  we love america well if you love america  you love the children  of america  and if you love the children of america  you understand  that when mom goes to work and when dad  goes to work  those children and their parents deserve  quality affordable child care  and we all know that today our current  child care system  is totally inadequate  our children and their parents  deserve better and that is why joe is  supporting  universal child care for all  three and four-year-olds in this country  [Music]  and when we talk about our childr